## Findings
{% set finding_count = 0 -%}
{% set resolved_count = 0 -%}
{% for e in events -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding" -%}
{% set_global finding_count = finding_count + 1 -%}
{% endif -%}
{% if e.event_type == "finding_resolved" -%}
{% set_global resolved_count = resolved_count + 1 -%}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
**Open:** {{ finding_count - resolved_count }} | **Resolved:** {{ resolved_count }} | **Total:** {{ finding_count }}
